#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor/scripts.inc:122
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor_Text_PeopleAndMonAreSame"
msgid ""
"People and POKéMON, they are but\n"
"the same…\p"
"Their individual nature makes them\n"
"good at certain things, and not good\l"
"at others.$"
msgstr ""
"人和宝可梦，\n"
"其实是一样的……\p"
"因为各自的性格，\n"
"它们有擅长的事，\l"
"也有不擅长的事。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor/scripts.inc:129
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor_Text_LetMonDoWhatItLikes"
msgid ""
"Rather than trying to make a POKéMON\n"
"do what it dislikes, try to let it do\l"
"what it likes and is good at doing.\p"
"Put yourself in the POKéMON's position\n"
"and consider what moves it would like.$"
msgstr ""
"与其勉强宝可梦去做\n"
"它不喜欢的事，\l"
"不如让它做喜欢又擅长的事。\p"
"站在宝可梦的立场上，\n"
"想想它会喜欢什么样的招式吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor/scripts.inc:136
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor_Text_MonDifferentWhenCornered"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON's nature is a remarkable\n"
"thing…\p"
"Some POKéMON behave in a completely\n"
"different way when they are cornered.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦的性格\n"
"是很奇妙的东西……\p"
"有些宝可梦在被逼入绝境时，\n"
"会表现得完全不同。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor/scripts.inc:142
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor_Text_BeginningToUnderstandNature"
msgid ""
"Are you beginning to understand how\n"
"a POKéMON's nature makes it behave?$"
msgstr ""
"你开始明白宝可梦的性格\n"
"会如何影响它的行动了吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor/scripts.inc:146
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePalaceCorridor_Text_HeartfeltBondBetweenYouAndMons"
msgid ""
"Ah… I see a strong, heartfelt bond\n"
"between you and your POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""
"啊……我看到了你和宝可梦之间\n"
"深厚而真挚的羁绊……$"
